# Server-side only — set these as Supabase Edge Function secrets, NOT in the browser env:
#   AARDVARK_WEBHOOK_SECRET  shared secret Aardvark sends to our aardvark-signup-complete webhook
#   AARDVARK_API_URL         Aardvark's callback API we POST to on our signup completion
#   AARDVARK_API_KEY         auth (bearer) for that callback API